    "passage": "Artificial Intelligence (AI) is becoming more and more popular nowadays. With the rising popularity of Artificial Intelligence (AI), this technology is closely ___1___ to our everyday lives. So far, AI has changed many ___2___ of our lives. It influences how we think, learn, and connect with others.\nMy experience with AI ___3___ when I was studying in school. Learning felt like a boring task full of memorizing and repeating things, ___4___ AI made it more interesting. AI tools analyzed (分析) my study results and created a personalized (个性化的) learning plan for me. They helped me focus on ___5___ I needed to improve and learn at my own speed. This made learning ___6___ and more fun than before.\nWhen I started working, AI continued to help. I used it ___7___ customer data and predict market trends. This saved me time and helped ___8___ make better decisions. I could spend more time on creative work instead of boring tasks.\nAI also played an important role in my personal life. It helped me discover information and online communities that matched my interests. ___9___ useful tool! But I also learned that it’s important to talk to people face to face, not only online.\nIn short, AI is ___10___ powerful tool. If we use it wisely, it can make our lives better.",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">Artificial Intelligence (AI) is becoming more and more popular nowadays. With the rising popularity of Artificial Intelligence (AI), this technology is closely <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;1&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> to our everyday lives. So far, AI has changed many <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;2&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> of our lives. It influences how we think, learn, and connect with others.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">My experience with AI <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;3&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> when I was studying in school. Learning felt like a boring task full of memorizing and repeating things, <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;4&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> AI made it more interesting. AI tools analyzed (分析) my study results and created a personalized (个性化的) learning plan for me. They helped me focus on <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;5&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> I needed to improve and learn at my own speed. This made learning <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;6&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> and more fun than before.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">When I started working, AI continued to help. I used it <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;7&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> customer data and predict market trends. This saved me time and helped <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;8&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> make better decisions. I could spend more time on creative work instead of boring tasks.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">AI also played an important role in my personal life. It helped me discover information and online communities that matched my interests. <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;9&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> useful tool! But I also learned that it’s important to talk to people face to face, not only online.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">In short, AI is <u>&nbsp;&nbsp;10&nbsp;&nbsp;</u> powerful tool. If we use it wisely, it can make our lives better.</span></p>",
