    "title": "七上A篇 · 二 学校课后社团活动",
    "passage": "School News\n\nWelcome back to school! For all the students here, we hope you’re ready for another great year. Do you take part in the after-school activities? If not, don’t worry! There’s still time. Here are some of the activities you can check out.\n\nDo you like sports? How about joining the football team? You can have a try next Monday and Tuesday at 3:00 p.m. Last year, our school football team won the first prize, but many of our best players left us for high school. For more information, meet our sports teacher, Mr. White.\n\nThis year the school art club plans to paint a mural on the wall by the office. So they need new members! Are you interested in drawing, painting, or taking photographs? This club is for you. The first meeting of the school year is next Wednesday at 3:15 p.m. in Room 221.\n\nThere are some new activities you can take part in. Try the new after-school science club if you want to try building a robot. Meet Ms. Matte in the Room 103 for more details (细节). The club meets every Thursday.\n\nDo you like acting? Are you good at singing? The school play this year is The Sound of Music. We meet every Monday and Wednesday afternoon in the school hall. Read the posters on the wall outside Room 145.\n\nFor all the activities, visit our school website or stop by the advisor’s office in Room 101.",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">School News</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Welcome back to school! For all the students here, we hope you’re ready for another great year. Do you take part in the after-school activities? If not, don’t worry! There’s still time. Here are some of the activities you can check out.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Do you like sports? How about joining the football team? You can have a try next Monday and Tuesday at 3:00 p.m. Last year, our school football team won the first prize, but many of our best players left us for high school. For more information, meet our sports teacher, Mr. White.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">This year the school art club plans to paint a mural on the wall by the office. So they need new members! Are you interested in drawing, painting, or taking photographs? This club is for you. The first meeting of the school year is next Wednesday at 3:15 p.m. in Room 221.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">There are some new activities you can take part in. Try the new after-school science club if you want to try building a robot. Meet Ms. Matte in the Room 103 for more details (细节). The club meets every Thursday.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Do you like acting? Are you good at singing? The school play this year is The Sound of Music. We meet every Monday and Wednesday afternoon in the school hall. Read the posters on the wall outside Room 145.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">For all the activities, visit our school website or stop by the advisor’s office in Room 101.</span></p>",
