    "title": "七上A篇 · 十 赵蚰竹与温馨家庭",
    "passage": "Zhao Youzhu is 29 years old. She is a student at Xiamen University (大学). She comes from Liaoyang, Liaoning. She can speak and read, but she can’t hear.\n\nZhao has short hair and wears glasses(眼镜). She likes reading very much. She has many books at home. “I often go to the library,” Zhao says. “That is my favorite place.” Sometimes, she also reads in parks.\n\nZhao’s parents are doctors. They often help their daughter. They are her teachers and friends, too. They love their daughter, and Zhao loves them, too.\n\nZhao has a sister. She is not in Xiamen, but she often talks with Zhao on the Internet (网络). Zhao often tells her some interesting stories.\n\n“I have a nice family, good teachers and many good friends,” Zhao says. “They make me strong and happy.”",
