    "title": "九上阅读 · 十一 熔岩灯的特点",
    "passage": "Do you want to make your room special? A lava lamp (熔岩灯) is a good choice. When you turn it on, the soft light will make you feel relaxed and comfortable. A lava lamp is not just for giving light, but also a mix of science and art. Making a lava lamp is fun. Do you want to have a try? Here comes the guide.\n\nI. Materials you need:\n\nA lamp, a clean glass, some water, some vegetable oil, a little food coloring and some pieces of Alka-Seltzer tablets (泡腾片).II. Steps to follow:\n\n① Choose a clean and dry glass.\n\n② Pour the vegetable oil into the glass until it is about 3/4 full. Then, add water slowly until the glass is nearly full.\n\n③ Add a few drops of food coloring into the mixture of water and oil. You can choose one color or several colors to get different effects.\n\n④ Break an Alka-Seltzer tablet into small pieces. Put one or two small pieces into the glass.\n\n⑤ Place the glass on the lamp. Turn it on and you will get the Lava Lamp Effect. III. The Science behind:\n\nLava lamps are made of a kind of special colored liquid (液体). This liquid shows a scientific principle that water and oil do not mix together. You can clearly see the colored water and oil moving up and down. They run in a fantastic way, just like a magic show. IV. Safety Tips:\n\nDon’t eat any of the materials.\n\nKeep the experiment away from open fire.\n\nWith a little effort and creativity, you can have your own lava lamp that will not only decorate your room but also bring you the fun of DIY!",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">Do you want to make your room special? A lava lamp (熔岩灯) is a good choice. When you turn it on, the soft light will make you feel relaxed and comfortable. A lava lamp is not just for giving light, but also a mix of science and art. Making a lava lamp is fun. Do you want to have a try? Here comes the guide.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\"><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:8px 0\"><img src=\"assets/images/jr_read9a_11_1.png\" alt=\"插图\" style=\"width:111px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px\"></div><b>I. Materials you need:</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">A lamp, a clean glass, some water, some vegetable oil, a little food coloring and some pieces of Alka-Seltzer tablets (泡腾片).<b>II. Steps to follow:</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">① Choose a clean and dry glass.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">② Pour the vegetable oil into the glass until it is about 3/4 full. Then, add water slowly until the glass is nearly full.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">③ Add a few drops of food coloring into the mixture of water and oil. You can choose one color or several colors to get different effects.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">④ Break an Alka-Seltzer tablet into small pieces. Put one or two small pieces into the glass.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">⑤ Place the glass on the lamp. Turn it on and you will get the Lava Lamp Effect. <b>III. The Science behind:</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Lava lamps are made of a kind of special colored liquid (液体). This liquid shows a scientific <u>principle</u> that water and oil do not mix together. You can clearly see the colored water and oil moving up and down. They run in a fantastic way, just like a magic show. <b>IV. Safety Tips:</b></span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Don’t eat any of the materials.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Keep the experiment away from open fire.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">With a little effort and creativity, you can have your own lava lamp that will not only decorate your room but also bring you the fun of DIY!</span></p>",
    "intro": "本文是一篇说明文，主要介绍了熔岩灯的特点，详细列出了制作熔岩灯所需的材料、步骤，解释了背后的科学原理，并给出了安全提示，旨在教人们如何在家制作熔岩灯。",
