    "passage": "Zhuhai is a wonderful city that always provides all kinds of activities for the public. Here are some plans of the activities for you.\n\nThe Family-friendly Activities\nCome and stay in our hotel! You will have a great time with your families. You can try delicious food, enjoy amazing penguin shows and have fun games. If you want to get more information, please log in the Chimelong Tourism Mini Program on WeChat. Time: Nov. 18th, 2024—Jan. 3rd, 2025\nPlace: Chimelong Penguin Hotel, Hengqin\nPrice: Free for guests who stay in the hotel\nThe Puppet Show\nCome and watch the puppet show! It’s from the famous story Journey to the West. You’ll enjoy the amazing adventure and feel the charm of traditional culture. Don’t miss it! Please go to the official WeChat account of Zhuhai Grand Theater to buy tickets. Time: Feb. 2nd, 2025\nPlace: Zhuhai Grand Theater, No. 129 Yuwan Road, Xiangzhou\nPrice: ¥120\nThe Sports Event\nCome and join us! Whether you are a professional runner or just want to challenge yourself, there are different kinds of races for you, the Full Marathon (42.195km), the Half Marathon (21.0975km) and the Mini Marathon (5km). Please click the website to sign up http://www.zhuhaimarathon.com. Time: Jan. 12, 2025\nPlace: Zhuhai Museum, Ji’an Road, Xiangzhou\nPrice: ¥200 for Full Marathon\n¥200 for Half Marathon\n¥80 for Mini Marathon\nThe Art Exhibition\nWe have 276 pieces of works from 123 countries and regions waiting for you. You can find the latest development of photography here. If you like taking photos, you can’t miss it. Please scan the QR code to make an appointment or search for introduction of the exhibition. Time: Nov. 2nd, 2024—Feb. 16th, 2025\nPlace: Guyuan Art Museum, No. 388 Meihua East Road, Xiangzhou\nPrice: Free\n\nCome and create nice memories with us in Zhuhai!",
