    "title": "九上阅读 · 十五 篇目十五",
    "passage": "Tea has played an important role in Chinese life since ancient times. When we need to relax, a cup of warm Chinese tea can always bring comfort. While many people enjoy drinking tea, not everyone knows the proper way to prepare it. Welcome to our workshop. You can learn how to make a good cup of Chinese tea for free.Time: 3:00 p.m.-5:30 p.m. Saturday (November 15)\nPlace: City Art Center\nNotes:● We’ll provide all the tools and materials.\n● For only 20 people.\n● To book a place for the activity, please scan the QR code by 8:00 p.m. Friday.\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………\nFor those who want to make a cup of tea at home for guests (客人), here are some tips for you.\nPlease prepare your favorite tea leaves. Then, get your tea sets ready: a tea tong, a teapot, a fair cup, teacups, and a tea tray.\nHere are the steps of making a cup of tea:■ Rinse the tea sets. Use a tea tong to hold the cup and clean it with hot water. You can clean other tea cups in the same way.\n■ Add tea leaves into the teapot. If you like strong tea, use more leaves; if you prefer a lighter taste, use fewer leaves.\n■ Rinse the tea leaves. Add hot water into the teapot. Steep (泡) 5-10 seconds, and pour out the water.\n■ Pour hot water into the teapot again until the teapot is about 4/5 full, leaving space for the tea leaves to unfurl. (展开)\n■ Pour the tea into a fair cup.\n■ Pour the tea into the tea cups. Then place the tea cups on the tea tray and offer it to the guest. Once the tea is served, you can sit back, share it with friends, and enjoy a peaceful moment together.",
    "passageHtml": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:10px 0\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid var(--bd);font-size:14px\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.65\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">Tea has played an important role in Chinese life since ancient times. When we need to relax, a cup of warm Chinese tea can always bring comfort. While many people enjoy drinking tea, not everyone knows the proper way to prepare it. Welcome to our workshop. You can learn how to make a good cup of Chinese tea for free.<b>Time:</b> 3:00 p.m.-5:30 p.m. Saturday (November 15)</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\"><b>Place:</b> City Art Center</p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:10px 0\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid var(--bd);font-size:14px\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.65\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\"><b>Notes:</b>● We’ll provide all the tools and materials.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">● For only 20 people.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">● To book a place for the activity, please scan the QR code by 8:00 p.m. Friday.</p></td><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:1.65\"><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:6px 0\"><img src=\"assets/images/jr_read9a_15_1.png\" alt=\"插图\" style=\"width:80px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px\"></div></td></tr></table></div><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">……………………………………………………………………………………………………………</p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;margin:10px 0\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid var(--bd);font-size:14px\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;line-height:1.65\"><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:6px 0\"><img src=\"assets/images/jr_read9a_15_2.png\" alt=\"插图\" style=\"width:139px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px\"></div></td><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.65\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">For those who want to make a cup of tea at home for guests (客人), here are some tips for you.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">Please prepare your favorite tea leaves. Then, get your tea sets ready: a tea tong, a teapot, a fair cup, teacups, and a tea tray.</p></td></tr></table></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;line-height:1.65\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\"><b>Here are the steps of making a cup of tea:</b>■ Rinse the tea sets. Use a tea tong to hold the cup and clean it with hot water. You can clean other tea cups in the same way.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">■ Add tea leaves into the teapot. If you like strong tea, use more leaves; if you prefer a lighter taste, use fewer leaves.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">■ Rinse the tea leaves. Add hot water into the teapot. Steep (泡) 5-10 seconds, and pour out the water.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">■ Pour hot water into the teapot again until the teapot is about 4/5 full, leaving space for the tea leaves to unfurl. (展开)</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">■ Pour the tea into a fair cup.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0;text-align:left\">■ Pour the tea into the tea cups. Then place the tea cups on the tea tray and offer it to the guest. Once the tea is served, you can sit back, share it with friends, and enjoy a peaceful moment together.</p></td></tr></table></div>",
