    "passage": "Whether you are a foreigner or an English speaker, English skills can always be improved. There are some tips that can not only help you learn English, but also improve your English skills.\n\nRead a book, a newspaper or a magazine in English, which is just above your level, with a dictionary. This will help you lean new vocabulary in a fun way. This is also a great tip on improving some useful English knowledge. Even by spending just 15 minutes a day, you can improve your English skills quickly.\n\nLearning grammar is necessary for learning a language. Knowing English grammar well is one of the top tips on learning English.\n\nKeeping a diary allows you to use all of your English skills that you’ve been practicing with reading and grammar. This is one of the greatest tips on improving English at any time when learning this language.\n\nWhen you feel you are ready, go for total immersion (投入) in English. This means making friends with English speakers around you and communicating with them. Of all English learning tips, this one will test all of your skills.\n\nDon’t forget to stimulate yourself after your hard work. You can buy yourself a small gift, such as an English record by your favorite singer. You can not only enjoy music, but also learn English by listening to English songs.\n\nLearning English is hard, but with these tips on learning English, you will get better.",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">Whether you are a foreigner or an English speaker, English skills can always be improved. There are some tips that can not only help you learn English, but also improve your English skills.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Read a book, a newspaper or a magazine in English, which is just above your level, with a dictionary. This will help you lean new vocabulary in a fun way. This is also a great tip on improving some useful English knowledge. Even by spending just 15 minutes a day, you can improve your English skills quickly.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Learning grammar is necessary for learning a language. Knowing English grammar well is one of the top tips on learning English.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Keeping a diary allows you to use all of your English skills that you’ve been practicing with reading and grammar. This is one of the greatest tips on improving English at any time when learning this language.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">When you feel you are ready, go for total immersion (投入) in English. This means making friends with English speakers around you and communicating with them. Of all English learning tips, this one will test all of your skills.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Don’t forget to <u>stimulate</u> yourself after your hard work. You can buy yourself a small gift, such as an English record by your favorite singer. You can not only enjoy music, but also learn English by listening to English songs.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">Learning English is hard, but with these tips on learning English, you will get better.</span></p>",
