    "passage": "Are you the only child in your family? How will you feel if you have a little brother or sister? Having a new baby in your family is really great but not easy for your parents.\n\nIt’s interesting for you to watch TV or play with the baby in your free time. If you are old enough, you can help your mum or dad look after (照顾) the baby, such as changing the dirty clothes or feeding the baby. But you should always ask mum or dad before (之前) you do these things for the baby. They will show you how to help look after your little brother or sister. Your mum will be very tired if the new baby cries at night. You may be able to help your mum by doing something nice for her, like getting ready for the warm water before she is going the bath the baby.\n\nYou may feel a bit jealous (妒忌) of the baby at times. Don’t think that you are a bad kid if you feel like that. It is normal for any kids to have such feelings. But remember that you should love the baby. Because you are a family.",
    "passageHtml": "<p><span class=\"ind\">Are you the only child in your family? How will you feel if you have a little brother or sister? Having a new baby in your family is really great but not easy for your parents.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">It’s interesting for you to watch TV or play with the baby in your free time. If you are old enough, you can help your mum or dad look after (照顾) the baby, such as changing the dirty clothes or feeding the baby. But you should always ask mum or dad before (之前) you do these things for the baby. They will show you how to help look after your little brother or sister. Your mum will be very tired if the new baby cries at night. You may be able to help your mum by doing something nice for her, like getting ready for the warm water before she is going the bath the baby.</span></p><p><span class=\"ind\">You may feel a bit jealous (妒忌) of the baby at times. Don’t think that you are a bad kid if you feel like that. It is <u>normal</u> for any kids to have such feelings. But remember that you should love the baby. Because you are a family.</span></p>",
